1
00:00:04,878 --> 00:00:19,108
现有的电信基础设施中大约有 100 吉瓦的电力，可以在智能时代得到利用。
There's roughly 100 gigawatts of power in the telecommunications
infrastructure that exists today that can be leveraged in the intelligence era.

2
00:00:19,662 --> 00:00:22,436
黄仁勋昨天提到了 10 万个站点。
Jensen talked yesterday about 100,000 sites.

3
00:00:22,894 --> 00:00:34,400
这些包括移动交换局、移动交换中心、接入点，所有
这些分布式电力都能在全新的 AI 世界中得到利用。
That's mobile switching offices, mobile exchanges, points of presence,
all of that distributed power can be leveraged in this new world of AI.

4
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:54,052
此外，我们考虑的连接性，无论是空中传输连接、光纤连接，还是背板连接，
在分布式智能和连接智能的世界中都变得至关重要。
Also, what we think about in terms of connectivity, connectivity, whether it be over-the-air, connectivity or fiber connectivity,
backplane connectivity, turning out to be essential in this world of distributed intelligence and connecting intelligence.

5
00:00:54,670 --> 00:00:56,228
AI 工厂，它们共同作用。
AI factories, together.

6
00:00:56,910 --> 00:01:05,028
当然，现在不仅仅是电信行业正在被 AI 和智能重塑。
Now, it's not just telecommunications, of course, that's being reshaped by AI and by intelligence.

7
00:01:05,519 --> 00:01:10,400
许多其他行业也在被重塑。
Many other industries as well are being reshaped as well.

8
00:01:10,574 --> 00:01:20,260
