But of course, what we don't often realize is many of the transformations happening in other industries require connectivity.

9
00:01:21,262 --> 00:01:32,356
智能化的连接性已成为整个行业 AI 革命中不可或缺的一部分。
Connectivity that is intelligent has become an essential part of this overall industry AI revolution.

10
00:01:32,686 --> 00:01:38,500
因此，电信行业往往会被视为这场革命的核心。
And so telecoms often will be seen as sitting at the center of this revolution.

11
00:01:39,822 --> 00:01:48,900
我们现在也开始看到电信行业正在经历这种变革的具体形态。
What we're also starting to see is the shape at which we're seeing how this transformation in telecoms is happening.

12
00:01:49,360 --> 00:01:59,680
当然，首先也是进展最快的一项——我将花点时间介绍——是 AI 基础设施的建设。
Of course, the first and fastest moving, which I'm going to spend a bit more time on, is AI infrastructure build-outs.

13
00:02:00,302 --> 00:02:09,316
