Today there's many AI, many telecommunications companies that have already started on that AI journey across the world.

14
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:15,652
他们有的已经深入到某些变革中，有的才刚刚开始。
And they're well, they're deep into some of that transformation, and some are just starting.

15
00:02:16,366 --> 00:02:18,436
我想说的是，开始。
What I would say is start.

16
00:02:19,470 --> 00:02:21,760
如果不开始，你就学不到任何东西。
If you don't start, you don't learn.

17
00:02:22,062 --> 00:02:33,284
我不是在泛泛而谈，这是我们从那些已经开始的公司中看到的经验。
And I'm not saying that just as a high-level statement, but that's our experience
that we've been able to see from the companies that have already started.

18
00:02:34,798 --> 00:02:35,760
AI RAN。
AI RAN.

