00:02:43,182 --> 00:02:58,084
但这也许是电信网络面临的最大机遇之一，因为这些网络本来就是为了向消费者、
订阅用户和企业提供无线接入网和连接而建立的。
But this is perhaps one of the biggest opportunities that presents itself to a telecommunications network that has been really set up
to deliver the radio access network and connectivity to consumers, subscribers, and businesses.

21
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:14,400
此外，对全球电信公司来说非常有意义的一点是，将
他们网络运营中巨大的开支转化为自主智能体运营。
And then one thing that's very meaningful to telcos around the world is the transformation of their network operations,
a very large expense, into autonomous agentic operations.

