00:03:22,574 --> 00:03:30,180
不过，你们需要思考的是我们这一周一直在听到的内容，也就是这个五层架构。
What you have to think about though is the same thing that we heard all week, which is this five-layer cake.

24
00:03:30,734 --> 00:03:36,676
所有这些变革都是在完全相同的平台上发生的。
All these three transformations are happening on exactly the same platform.

25
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:39,044
