That is essential.

26
00:03:39,822 --> 00:03:50,756
正是同样的五层架构支撑着这些变革，并推动着全球的 AI 建设和 AI 革命。
It's the same five layer cake supporting these transformations that is driving the AI build out, AI revolution around the world.

27
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:52,320
