00:04:00,928 --> 00:04:07,332
当然，我们知道能源受限于土地电力资源的可用性。
Of course, we know energy is driven by the availability of land power shell.

31
00:04:07,968 --> 00:04:17,988
大规模可用性，获取大型土地电力资产正变得越来越困难。
Large availability, availability of large land power shell assets is becoming harder and harder to come by.

32
00:04:18,637 --> 00:04:28,580
因此，电信领域现有的分布式资产现在正成为核心因素。
So this distributed assets that exist within telecommunications is really now starting to become a primary factor.

33
00:04:29,262 --> 00:04:38,608
说到算力，我之前提到过，我们看到 AI 和电信领域的 AI 技术栈是相同的。
When we think about compute, I mentioned this earlier, which is we're seeing that AI stack being the same across AI and telco.

