I'll show you some examples of that.

42
00:05:41,390 --> 00:05:56,772
当然，你们在现场以及在许多会议中都能看到一些令人惊叹的 AI 应用，
现在它们还包括软件定义 5G，以及未来的 6G。
And of course, you're seeing on the floor today, but also in many of the sessions,
some of the amazing AI applications that now also include software-defined 5G and moving forward 6G.

43
00:05:58,318 --> 00:06:01,700
所以，现在是进入电信领域的最佳时机。
So there has never been a better time to be in telecommunications.

44
