from Charter, and also from our friends TELUS.

50
00:06:46,222 --> 00:06:49,408
在整个北美，这种变革正在发生。
Across North America, this transformation is happening.

51
00:06:49,568 --> 00:06:53,008
这些只是我们看到的一些声明。
This is just some of their statements that we're seeing.

52
