And the same story is playing out across Asia.

56
00:07:20,878 --> 00:07:31,556
我们可以看到一些令人惊叹的基础设施建设，而且电信
运营商现在开始谈论他们以前从未见过的投资回报率。
What we can see is some amazing build-outs and telcos that are now
starting to talk about return on investments that they haven't seen before.

57
00:07:31,808 --> 00:07:33,328
需求简直疯了。
Demand is insane.

58
00:07:34,190 --> 00:07:36,196
变现已经开始了。
Monetization has begun.

59
00:07:38,926 --> 00:07:41,732
AI 采用现在是首要任务。
AI adoption is now the top priority.

60
00:07:42,478 --> 00:07:52,452
这些都是你大概永远、或者说极大概率永远不会从两三年前的电信运营商那里听到的内容。
These are things that are you would probably never, or not probably, will never have heard from telcos two, three years ago.

61
00:07:53,806 --> 00:07:59,248
现在在欧洲，我们也看到了同样的情况。
And now here in Europe, we're seeing the same play out.

62
00:07:59,374 --> 00:08:13,824
