你必须能够在整个基础设施上运行软件，而且是在整个基础设施上运行相同的软件。
You need to be able to run software across that entire infrastructure, and the same software across that entire infrastructure.

70
00:09:09,454 --> 00:09:22,308
DT 宣布他们正在扩展并构建他们一段时间前开始与 NVIDIA 合作的工业云，将其扩展到分布式云。
DT is announcing that they're extending and building out their industrial cloud
