71
00:09:22,784 --> 00:09:41,344
此外，他们已经能够与合作伙伴 Nokia 合作试点 AI RAN，
目前他们已经看到基于 Nokia 软件的实验室上行性能提升了 10% 到 15%。
And also that they've been able to pilot now AI RAN with their partner Nokia, and what they've been able to do now is already see 10
to 15% uplink performance improvement in labs based upon the Nokia software.

72
00:09:43,086 --> 00:09:49,316
