00:09:56,944 --> 00:10:06,724
一种模式是机器人运行在世界基础模型已在云端训练好，并完全在机器人上运行的模式。
One is the robot's being run in a mode where the World Foundation model
has been trained in the cloud and it's running entirely on the robot.

75
00:10:07,150 --> 00:10:14,372
机器人通过摄像头进行感知，它经过训练，现在正在执行动作。
The robot is perceiving through cameras, and it's been trained and it's now acting.

76
00:10:15,118 --> 00:10:27,620
在另一种模式中，就在它旁边，你会看到连接到边缘 RTX Pro 6000 的机器人，
那个世界基础模型就在那里运行。
In the other, sitting right next to it, you'll see now the robot that's connected to an edge RTX Pro 6000,
where that world foundational model is running.

77
00:10:28,046 --> 00:10:44,964
你会看到感知是在边缘端完成的，而不是在机器人上，这样它就能感知下一个任务并采取行动，
同时知道这种感知信息正通过连接传输到机器人上。
and you'll see the perception that's able to be happening on the edge as opposed to the robot,
so it can perceive the next task and act, knowing on the connectivity of that perception being transferred to the robot.

78
00:10:45,422 --> 00:11:03,396
你可以看到这个机器人正在把风扇放入服务器中，而运行在分布式 AI 基础设施上的机器人，
你看它运行得多么顺滑，而且任务的循环时间也快得多。
What you can see is this robot's picking and placing fans into a server, and the robot that's running on the distributed AI infra,
see how much smoother, and also the cycle time of the task, how much faster it is.

79
00:11:03,824 --> 00:11:06,532
这就是边缘计算的力量。
That's the power of the edge.

80
00:11:07,502 --> 00:11:11,024
人们经常问，为什么边缘计算很重要？
People often ask why is the edge important?

81
00:11:11,470 --> 00:11:17,104
我们长期以来一直拥有边缘计算的潜力，但在 AI 时代之前并不是如此。
We've had an edge potential for a long time, but not in the era of AI.

82
00:11:17,646 --> 00:11:27,748
这是完全全新的应用可用性，通过将边缘计算与连接能力相结合来实现。
This is a completely new availability of applications that can be serviced by the edge by combining that with connectivity.

83
00:11:29,422 --> 00:11:35,876
