And what you will see is this translation that's happening real time in an emergency service application.

86
00:12:07,246 --> 00:12:22,404
这个试点使用的是 Nemotron 语音到语音模型，它是全双工的，还包括语调识别和语义识别。
This pilot is using a Nemotron speech to speech model that is full duplex
and also includes recognition of tone and also semantic recognition.

87
00:12:22,926 --> 00:12:23,844
让我们来看看。
Let's watch it.

88
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:28,480
你好。
Hallo.

