谢谢。
Danke.

95
00:12:50,894 --> 00:12:53,040
我正为您转接到工作人员那里。
Ich verbinde Sie mit einem Mitarbeiter.

96
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:06,480
不，我们还在外面。
Nein, wir sind noch draußen.

97
00:13:06,766 --> 00:13:09,360
没有人受伤，但烟雾越来越浓了。
Niemand ist verletzt, aber der Rauch wird immer dicker.

98
00:13:12,160 --> 00:13:14,480
好的，消防员已经在路上了。
Alright, the firefighters are already on their way.

99
00:13:26,158 --> 00:13:34,884
您刚才看到的是实时翻译，这也是一个对延迟敏感的应用，边缘计算在其中起到了关键作用。
What you saw there was real-time translation, but also a latency sensitive application where the edge makes a difference.

100
00:13:35,280 --> 00:13:44,516
再次强调，这是边缘计算和 Orange 的一个真实应用案例，
Orange 正通过其实时智能平台提供这一服务。
Again, a real use case for edge and orange is deli Orange is delivering that
with their will be delivering that with their live intelligence platform.

101
00:13:46,478 --> 00:13:50,116
我刚才提到了 AI 工厂。
I talked earlier about AI factories.

102
00:13:50,926 --> 00:14:00,836
在欧洲，值得思考的是许多电信运营商在考虑部署 AI 工厂时所经历的历程。
And here in Europe, it's worth thinking about the journey that many telcos
have gone through as they start to think about deploying AI factories.

103
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:14,628
最初围绕 GPU 即服务，然后转向模型即服务，再到推理即服务，
并在其基础上提供 AI 应用和服务。
Initially around GPU as a service, moving up to models as a service, moving up to inference as a service,
