104
00:14:15,310 --> 00:14:21,988
因此，在过去的两年里，我们看到这种趋势在整个欧洲开始发展。
And so across Europe, we've seen this now start to develop over the last two years.

105
00:14:22,478 --> 00:14:25,892
有些是中心化的，有些是分布式的。
Some of them centralized, some of them distributed.

